# Determiners that open a fraction of three to ten parts: "another third of
# the month", "some third of the month".  Wiktionary, "third", noun sense 2:
# "One of three equal parts of a whole", with the example "He ate a third of
# the pie."  Before "first", "second" or an ordinal above ten the same words
# leave a day: "another first of the month", "any fifteenth of the month".
another
some
any
